  <metadata>
    <name>RI-05 · Old Cascade Highway</name>
    <desc>Countless hairpins and no services on the Christina Lake–Rossland mountain crossing; distinct from the non-motorized Dewdney Trail. Coarse corridor geometry; not a turn-by-turn track. Verify land access, closures, gates, weather and field signage.</desc>
